  "details": "I recall in the patch notes that player set velocity is supposed to set the isPlayerGrounded to false on the frame that it executes, but it's very inconsistent. It's to the point where depending on where one is standing, it may work 50% of the time, or not at all.\n\nHere's a world to demonstrate it:\nwrld_c3d68bab-9ec4-455e-91df-8560f750a26a\n\nOnly works in VR, use the grips to boost around. The platform in dark grey above demonstrates the problem the best. Seems like no matter what I do to it or no matter what I change, players glue to it unless they aim directly upwards.",
